{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalLichnerowicz","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalLichnerowicz","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Defs"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.qDirac_parallel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.qDirac_parallel","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L74-L82","doc":"**Parallel-Reeb specialisation.** If additionally the q-scalar\ncurvature vanishes (the parallel-Reeb background of Bring's\nsurface — `ex:categorical-reeb-brings`), the identity simplifies\nto Δ_∇^q = 𝔇_∇². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.qDirac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.qDirac","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L66-L72","doc":"**Theorem (categorical Lichnerowicz).** Given the structural data,\nthe q-Laplacian equals the squared Dirac plus the q-scalar-\ncurvature correction. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-lichnerowicz","label":"prop:categorical-lichnerowicz","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.cartan_and_clifford","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.cartan_and_clifford","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Clifford-multiplication and Cartan-formula identify cross term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.weitzenbock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.weitzenbock","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The categorical Weitzenböck assembly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.crossTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.crossTerm","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The cross term from Weitzenböck. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qScalarCurv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qScalarCurv","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The q-scalar curvature contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qDiracSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qDiracSq","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The squared categorical Dirac operator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qLaplacian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.qLaplacian","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The categorical q-Laplacian on Ω¹(End V). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Lichnerowicz.QDiracLichnerowiczData","kind":"structure","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lichnerowicz.lean#L48-L64","doc":"**Abstract setup for the categorical Lichnerowicz identity.**\nPackages the four structural ingredients (a)–(d) from the .md\nproof as fields of a single data structure. The categorical\nLichnerowicz identity follows by composition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}